//// rakun-data — module-tree root.
////
//// Part of the Rakun framework (Spring Boot for Botopink/Erlang). Reached by a
//// consumer via `import {…} from "rakun-data"`.
////
//// The order here is a DEPENDENCY order and `botopink.json`'s `files` repeats
//// it, because a consumer's build reads that list literally: a module listed
//// before a sibling it imports reds with `unbound variable` inside this
//// member's own source.
////
//// Front 08 owns this file and the manifest as the lowest-numbered front in the
//// member: `datasource` (the generic DataSource, the pool, the boot) and `sql`
//// (the SQL arm). Fronts 09, 77 and 78 append `pub mod nosql;`,
//// `pub mod migration;` and `pub mod orm;` below, in front-number order, and
//// reorder nothing.

pub mod datasource;
pub mod sql;
